{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8aadf7a8-a5fd-4167-b52c-9d40b3271593",
    "name": "StudyMind Redação — Senha",
    "description": "Esqueci minha senha, redefinir pelo link e alterar logado.\n\nAntes de rodar: defina `email` (conta que já existe) e, depois do passo 1, cole em `tokenRedefinicao` o token do e-mail (o que vem depois de #token=). Os passos 4 em diante mudam a senha da conta.\n\nLimites: esqueci-senha 3/h por e-mail e 5/h por IP; redefinir 10/min por IP; alterar 5 a cada 15 min por conta.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Esqueci minha senha (202)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/esqueci-senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "esqueci-senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Com EMAIL_HABILITADO=true chega um e-mail com o link /redefinir-senha#token=... (vale 30 min). Copie o que vem depois de #token= para a variável tokenRedefinicao.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 202\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
              "pm.test(\"Mensagem neutra\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().mensagem).to.include(\"Se existir uma conta\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Esqueci minha senha - e-mail que não existe (mesma resposta)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/esqueci-senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "esqueci-senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ninguem.{{$timestamp}}@teste.com\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 202 mesmo sem conta\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
              "pm.test(\"Mesma mensagem\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().mensagem).to.include(\"Se existir uma conta\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Redefinir senha - senha fraca (400, não queima o link)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/redefinir-senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "redefinir-senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{tokenRedefinicao}}\",\n  \"novaSenha\": \"curta\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "pm.test(\"Mensagem da regra de senha\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.include(\"senha\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Redefinir senha (204)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/redefinir-senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "redefinir-senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{tokenRedefinicao}}\",\n  \"novaSenha\": \"{{senhaNova}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 204\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Redefinir de novo com o mesmo link (400 TOKEN_INVALIDO)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/redefinir-senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "redefinir-senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{tokenRedefinicao}}\",\n  \"novaSenha\": \"{{senhaNova}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "pm.test(\"Código TOKEN_INVALIDO\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"TOKEN_INVALIDO\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Login com a senha nova",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{senhaNova}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", pm.response.json().accessToken);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Alterar senha - senha atual errada (400 SENHA_ATUAL_INCORRETA)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/me/senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "usuarios",
            "me",
            "senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"senhaAtual\": \"senhaErrada999\",\n  \"novaSenha\": \"{{senhaTrocada}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{accessToken}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 400 (não 401)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "pm.test(\"Código SENHA_ATUAL_INCORRETA\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"SENHA_ATUAL_INCORRETA\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Alterar senha (200 com token novo)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/me/senha",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "usuarios",
            "me",
            "senha"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"senhaAtual\": \"{{senhaNova}}\",\n  \"novaSenha\": \"{{senhaTrocada}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{accessToken}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const novo = pm.response.json().accessToken;",
              "pm.test(\"Devolve um token novo\", () => pm.expect(novo).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"accessToken\")));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenAntigo\", pm.collectionVariables.get(\"accessToken\"));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", novo);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Token de antes da troca não vale mais (401)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/me",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "usuarios",
            "me"
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: \"Authorization\", value: \"Bearer \" + pm.collectionVariables.get(\"tokenAntigo\") });"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Token novo continua valendo (200)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/me",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "usuarios",
            "me"
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{accessToken}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
